{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0237cffb75ee9d567d6eee3d9c91565059affce0015b4512dedcd1da50762ce1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"locoremind/locotrainer@08a2a06e2122 snapshot d3f570970b8c0cf2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ea9b047c61802f117b13f5563dd37bc0b5a788b62451b4b4d54cadfa8ceb0529"],"source_ids":["src_0495ebe5297654968d49be4b71fd32a7"],"text":"The CLI exposes `locotrainer run` with options -q (question), -c (codebase path), -o (output dir), -m (model), --max-turns (default 20), and --quiet.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_064e83b2c3099b75e6e1a1b6b4cc23fbb12d3a5712cee1df7f2f28ef11c5b4f5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"locoremind/locotrainer@08a2a06e2122 snapshot d3f570970b8c0cf2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_bc87ab96fbbe3a01230c66983e153d1b0733da46b80529885494aaf31d022004","slc_faa6793e3bf6c78e3238e34cb687e0ebcb1f1618c38078544f52004ba3d92352"],"source_ids":["src_0495ebe5297654968d49be4b71fd32a7"],"text":"The model was trained with full-parameter SFT on 361,830 samples (agent trajectories, MS-SWIFT knowledge, project paths) at 32,768 max sequence length on 8x H100 80GB for about 25 hours.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1549f40f863df3c418096736d013847881514aa9f3275232203f733d5a11db98","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"locoremind/locotrainer@08a2a06e2122 snapshot d3f570970b8c0cf2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_121469afcb7c8886d34747601b7e542304c87371055a494838ac7bc19a47818e","slc_c97164e448f6b3d1bb8d0cb689dc3c5c0d90e29a189c8b5b1210b4e495bd88e5"],"source_ids":["src_0495ebe5297654968d49be4b71fd32a7"],"text":"The framework simulates a Claude Code-style agent environment, matching what LocoTrainer-4B was trained on, and injects absolute paths into user content plus tolerant tool argument parsing for reliability.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1c72e224967adf210e6535bf25b4ab81ae999e25c1312950ea5c0fded0fb13e3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"locoremind/locotrainer@08a2a06e2122 snapshot d3f570970b8c0cf2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_808adec86e02b4a1d7d5d002e1051056ea67f8cb67db127c43405808cfb905aa"],"source_ids":["src_0495ebe5297654968d49be4b71fd32a7"],"text":"The framework comprises modules for prompts (SYSTEM_PROMPT, get_system_reminder), a ToolExecutor (Read/Grep/Glob/Write/Bash), an agent loop, config loading, ms-swift auto-clone logic, and a Click CLI.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_29e97af210a2b08be49d2611de49b8e80d76c6e0394ac529367b161a0e3dc611","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"locoremind/locotrainer@08a2a06e2122 snapshot d3f570970b8c0cf2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_35655db51dbc440b008cc11ee268643c749fcf8869551e6877232d5fc465718c","slc_7d2c211f42cc6008c409ade09154df168419c2d9b21b8809fb23ec64df51c84b"],"source_ids":["src_0495ebe5297654968d49be4b71fd32a7"],"text":"The project is MIT-licensed and distributed on PyPI with model weights (full and GGUF) on Hugging Face, plus a Colab notebook.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4c0eab9e4411514de0aa070559bf1633e1e85a5052276c44090911b834993c63","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"locoremind/locotrainer@08a2a06e2122 snapshot d3f570970b8c0cf2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_933170d55d29fbec1ec361c2e1511b94b8b975dc6abd81dab90e2b963e6b8f0d"],"source_ids":["src_0495ebe5297654968d49be4b71fd32a7"],"text":"Documented limitations: specialization to MS-SWIFT with untested performance elsewhere, 4B scale possibly limiting complex multi-hop reasoning, and framework-structure knowledge tied to the training-data snapshot that may drift.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9c9e5e939370a6dc95ea24e3970e714033227e2ded8cec266a5bd1cadc972f3a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"locoremind/locotrainer@08a2a06e2122 snapshot d3f570970b8c0cf2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_06c44b7fab2fa888beb42c45869e96adc84764cfbe21fd1eb6a4625fb1c5a422","slc_eef79f066494a5b9abb5b30cbf132aa02287ca704c55c24cda063985671d59c4"],"source_ids":["src_0495ebe5297654968d49be4b71fd32a7"],"text":"LocoTrainer-4B is described as a 4B-parameter MS-SWIFT domain expert agent distilled from Qwen3-Coder-Next, combining tool-calling with framework knowledge.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c76f78899878b51e353ed46333fb4d9ce88da054d3012a6e9f5bf832b0f30415","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"locoremind/locotrainer@08a2a06e2122 snapshot d3f570970b8c0cf2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2b51d9fa58f4d0e130c7dc2b85f52091337938fcecbb3340144fd6652987a663","slc_86d09295404a5b3621a85248d262ed691d224b6417cadfa77d2bfe4e139ddf96","slc_b4db5e68659170dcafe7870e450d1b23d435d8f300bc548c430a7f3a26a15df0"],"source_ids":["src_0495ebe5297654968d49be4b71fd32a7"],"text":"The product requires an OpenAI-compatible API endpoint (e.g., DashScope, OpenRouter, or a local llama.cpp server) and auto-clones the ms-swift repository on first use when no codebase path is given.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_dc61070f5634b4aca6218a4dbeee86bf4ffde5afd6ee5be49e69a5cb95bc034c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"locoremind/locotrainer@08a2a06e2122 snapshot d3f570970b8c0cf2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5d2bd08a586b2ba13c2a1d4c9fa4cbc2521f46a2d4538b043f72e0083103d076"],"source_ids":["src_0495ebe5297654968d49be4b71fd32a7"],"text":"Configuration uses environment variables such as LOCOTRAINER_API_KEY, LOCOTRAINER_BASE_URL (default OpenAI endpoint), LOCOTRAINER_MODEL (default gpt-4o), LOCOTRAINER_MAX_TURNS, LOCOTRAINER_MAX_TOKENS, LOCOTRAINER_ENABLE_THINKING, LOCOTRAINER_CODEBASE, and LOCOTRAINER_OUTPUT_DIR.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_de976b8224b49454f4339ccc8c66cc82ecaaf00f78c0ae02ce4eb52035c0a556","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"locoremind/locotrainer@08a2a06e2122 snapshot d3f570970b8c0cf2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0d9fd572ac3821a6de953917d297e02b05ab078c976e44c768ce135f572efae3","slc_57ba21c96bfaededfda10a8e5de8b6e9e31729c038354c94cdafc7a47b7c85a3"],"source_ids":["src_0495ebe5297654968d49be4b71fd32a7"],"text":"Reported evaluation on MS-SWIFT analysis tasks across 3 iterations shows Read success rising from 0% (relative paths) to 100% (absolute paths), and Write success reaching 100% only with tolerant argument parsing, with the final test producing a 225-line report in 9 turns.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f9cd9ae874ceed0b9498fe3d2c5dc700794bfc74ae53682c71207a6eee1dbd19","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"locoremind/locotrainer@08a2a06e2122 snapshot d3f570970b8c0cf2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_cbd105fb124dd0ee245d4d3c6242ea279c54f08e1cd718ed33dbc4b453f78385"],"source_ids":["src_0495ebe5297654968d49be4b71fd32a7"],"text":"The agent loop sends tool calls (Read/Grep/Glob/Bash) against the real filesystem, feeds results back for the next turn, and writes a final markdown report plus a full trajectory JSON to the output directory.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","created_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_fd8af98bae195ea6abd56bedd8657e418a9accf3e38a5189dee77f5f64346f8e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"locoremind/locotrainer@08a2a06e2122 snapshot d3f570970b8c0cf2","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_86d09295404a5b3621a85248d262ed691d224b6417cadfa77d2bfe4e139ddf96","slc_cbd105fb124dd0ee245d4d3c6242ea279c54f08e1cd718ed33dbc4b453f78385"],"source_ids":["src_0495ebe5297654968d49be4b71fd32a7"],"text":"The agent emits structured tool-call JSON for Read, Grep, Glob, Bash, and Write tools executed against the target codebase.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:13:32Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ea17a093aec2461a8ad648a3eaece48c"}
